<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>67.0</apiVersion>
    <decisions>
        <description>활성 상태의 First Ticket Campaign 레코드가 조회되었는지 확인</description>
        <name>Check_If_First_Ticket_Campaign_Found</name>
        <label>Check If First Ticket Campaign Found</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Campaign Not Found</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Campaign_Found</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_First_Ticket_Campaign.Id</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Add_Fan_to_First_Ticket_Campaign</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Campaign Found</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>가입 후 7일이 지난 팬의 결제 완료 티켓 구매 이력 존재 여부를 판단</description>
        <name>Check_If_Ticket_Purchase_Exists</name>
        <label>Check If Ticket Purchase Exists</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Paid Ticket Purchase Exists</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>No_Paid_Ticket_Purchase</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Paid_Ticket_Purchase.Id</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_First_Ticket_Campaign</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>No Paid Ticket Purchase</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>신규 Person Account 생성 7일 후 결제 완료된 티켓 구매 이력이 없는지 확인하고 First Ticket Campaign 대상 등록 및 안내 이력을 생성</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>First Ticket Campaign Flow - V1 {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>First Ticket Campaign Flow -CA</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
        <description>티켓 구매 이력이 없는 신규 팬을 First Ticket Campaign의 Campaign Member로 등록</description>
        <name>Add_Fan_to_First_Ticket_Campaign</name>
        <label>Add Fan to First Ticket Campaign</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Create_First_Ticket_Campaign_Notification</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>CampaignId</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Get_First_Ticket_Campaign.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>ContactId</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.PersonContactId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>CampaignMember</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordCreates>
        <description>First Ticket Campaign 대상 팬에게 발송한 첫 관람 유도 안내 이력을 Notification Log에 생성</description>
        <name>Create_First_Ticket_Campaign_Notification</name>
        <label>Create First Ticket Campaign Notification</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Campaign__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Get_First_Ticket_Campaign.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Channel__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>SMS</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Content__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>첫 경기 관람 10% 할인 쿠폰이 도착했어요.</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Fan__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Sent_Date__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Flow.CurrentDateTime</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Notification_Log__c</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordLookups>
        <description>티켓 구매 이력이 없는 팬을 등록할 활성 First Ticket Campaign 레코드를 조회</description>
        <name>Get_First_Ticket_Campaign</name>
        <label>Get First Ticket Campaign</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Check_If_First_Ticket_Campaign_Found</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>IsActive</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Name</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>First Ticket Campaign</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Campaign</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <description>가입 후 7일이 지난 팬에게 결제 완료된 티켓 구매 이력이 있는지 조회</description>
        <name>Get_Paid_Ticket_Purchase</name>
        <label>Get Paid Ticket Purchase</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Check_If_Ticket_Purchase_Exists</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>AccountId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Order_Type__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Ticket Purchase</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Payment_Status__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Paid</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Order</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <start>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>IsPersonAccount</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <object>Account</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Create</recordTriggerType>
        <scheduledPaths>
            <name>X7_Days_After_Fan_Registration</name>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Paid_Ticket_Purchase</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>7 Days After Fan Registration</label>
            <offsetNumber>7</offsetNumber>
            <offsetUnit>Days</offsetUnit>
            <recordField>CreatedDate__c</recordField>
            <timeSource>RecordField</timeSource>
        </scheduledPaths>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
</Flow>
